# 情境 04：密碼錯誤無法取得明文（對應 T2）
reset all

# V1：拿不到內容，但檔名是明文，伺服器與錯誤密碼的人都看得到
login v1 right-password
upload secret.txt TOP SECRET PLAN
login v1 wrong-password
ls
expect contains secret.txt
cat #1
expect not-contains TOP SECRET PLAN

# V2：清單 HMAC 驗證失敗，直接拒絕
login v2 right-password
upload secret.txt TOP SECRET PLAN
login v2 wrong-password
ls
expect rejected
cat #1
expect rejected
expect not-contains TOP SECRET PLAN
